window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>There are two types of hell.</p> <p>The one priests preach about and then this.</p> <p>Stuck on an alien slave ship, Piper is auctioned and thrown into a cell with...something.</p> <p>He’s an alien with a reputation.</p> <p>A warrior. A beast. A killer.</p> <p>He is dangerous.</p> <p>A creature with a cold, cold heart...one not unlike her own.</p> <p>You’d think falling for an alien killing machine was something so far-fetched it would never happen.</p> <p>Well, so was being abducted out of 7.5 billion other humans on Earth - and that had occurred so...</p> <p>Hey, what’s the worst that could happen?</p> <p>Contains steamy scenes.</p> <p>Crex is book two in the Captured by Aliens series. It is a complete stand-alone so it can be listened on its own. However, the story will be more enjoyable if the audiobooks are listened in order.</p>"; 
